Package: punkstR
Title: Drive the 'punkst' Spatial Transcriptomics Pipeline from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Vincent", "Carey", email = "stvjc@channing.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Checks for the required executables and files, then runs the
    'punkst' command line tools and a small Python export script with
    'system2()'. No Python modules are imported into R. Includes an export of
    SpatialData (zarr) point elements to the transcript format 'punkst'
    expects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: jsonlite, Matrix, S7, utils
Suggests: knitr, quarto, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
